  {
    "name": "Word's save with the connection dropping between its steps: one document with the new content, no temp file on the drive, no copy",
    "description": "ICLOUD-026 (sync-chaos port-office-save-interrupted): Excel's save over a flaky network left only the temp file 727F3C00 in iCloud. Rules P10 and D6: a pass in the middle of a save deletes nothing (save-in-progress), the other device keeps the old version, then gets the new one; a lost connection between the steps changes nothing of that.",
