  {
    "name": "Excel's save through an extensionless temp file, then a save on the other device right after the round trip: no orphan temp, no 'Book 2'",
    "description": "ICLOUD-026: Excel writes 727F3C00, renames the workbook aside, renames the temp in, deletes the old one; on the Mac a save right after iCloud's round trip made 'Name 2.ext'. Rules P10, A3 and C3: the save is one replace on the drive; the next save on the other device is a plain edit.",
